OL,3,GNEWSAHarbour offers vegetable oil fuel
OL,4,Ato boat owners
OL,5,
OL,6,FA harbour is offering hydrotreated
OL,7,Fvegetable oil (HVO) to boat owners for
OL,8,Fthe first time.
OL,10,FFalmouth Harbour has used the renewable
OL,11,Falternative to marine diesel to power
OL,12,Fits fleet of workboats for a year and
OL,13,Fhas now put it on sale at its fuel
OL,14,Fberth for leisure and commercial
OL,15,Fcustomers.
OL,17,FThe harbour authority said HVO fuel,
OL,18,Fmade from recycled materials like used
OL,19,Fcooking oil and farm waste, could
OL,20,Freduce carbon emissions by 50% to 90%
OL,21,Fwhen compared with fossil fuel diesel.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
