OL,3,GNEWSAHarbour offers vegetable oil fuel
OL,4,Ato boat owners
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe HVO fuel could be used by boat
OL,7,Fowners whose engines which are approved
OL,8,Fto the EN 15940 standard and who have
OL,9,Fchecked with their manufacturer, the
OL,10,Fauthority added.
